# ── Production build settings that are public by nature ─────────────────────
# Loaded by `vite build` (production mode), locally and on Vercel. Only values
# that are safe in a public repo belong here: never keys or secrets.
#
# A Vercel environment variable with the same name still wins over this file.

# The one public origin search engines should know: canonical links, the
# sitemap and robots.txt (src/lib/site-config.ts). A production build refuses
# to run without it, or with a non-https value, or one with a path.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://studentos.co.za
